    ],
    "facts": "Dental veneers are wafer-thin, custom-made shells bonded to the front surfaces of teeth. They cover cosmetic flaws like stains, chips, cracks, small gaps, and minor misalignments, improving the appear...",
    "details": "Dental veneers are wafer-thin, custom-made shells bonded to the front surfaces of teeth. They cover cosmetic flaws like stains, chips, cracks, small gaps, and minor misalignments, improving the appearance of your smile without repairing deep structural damage. Veneers primarily serve aesthetic goals by masking imperfections and enhancing tooth uniformity."
