    "facts": "Porcelain veneers are crafted in a lab and offer superior durability, stain resistance, and natural translucency, often lasting 10\u201315 years. Composite veneers are applied directly in the dentist\u2019s cha...",
    "details": "Porcelain veneers are crafted in a lab and offer superior durability, stain resistance, and natural translucency, often lasting 10\u201315 years. Composite veneers are applied directly in the dentist\u2019s chair, cost less, but tend to stain and wear faster, usually lasting about 5\u20137 years."
  },
