    "details": "A natural smile design enhances your existing features for a subtle, authentic look. The teeth are shaded to complement your skin tone with slight variations that mimic natural enamel. Alignment is balanced and may retain minor imperfections, and treatments like composite bonding, whitening, and clear aligners preserve natural tooth structure. Unlike the Hollywood approach, it doesn\u2019t aim for a perfectly uniform look."
