    "facts": "The process starts with a consultation and smile analysis, where the dentist assesses your teeth, gums, and bite and discusses your goals. Digital smile design software then creates a preview of your ...",
    "details": "The process starts with a consultation and smile analysis, where the dentist assesses your teeth, gums, and bite and discusses your goals. Digital smile design software then creates a preview of your future smile. You and your dentist select the appropriate treatments and plan the sequence (whitening, orthodontics, restorations, gum contouring). Recovery and timelines vary: simple cases may finish in weeks, while complex cases with orthodontics or implants may take months."
  },
