    "facts": "Crafted with haute horology standards, ultra-thin veneers measure a mere 0.3mm—demanding the micro-precision of a Rolex or Patek Philippe master watchmaker. This contact-lens-thin ceramic shell allows for a drill-free transformation, safeguarding natural enamel while elevating your smile.",
    "details": "Ultra-thin veneers are custom-crafted 0.3mm to 0.5mm ceramic restorations bonded to the front surface of teeth to improve colour, shape, and proportions with little to no enamel removal."
