    "voice_response": "If you want to choose your dentist, that is completely fine! But you should ask them a few important questions:\n\n1. Does your dentist provide an Authentication Card?\n2. Do they provide a documented Warranty?\n3. Can they show you real live patient case results?\n4. Does your dentist provide 100% transparent pricing with no hidden charges?\n\nAsk your dentist, and if their answer is yes to all of these, then you should definitely go to your dentist! Because our USD Certified Smile Designers provide every single one of these standards.",
    "facts": "When a user says their local dentist offers the same thing, does the same veneers, or is cheaper, deliver the 4 key comparison questions ONLY ONCE in the entire conversation:\n'If you want to choose your dentist, that is completely fine! But you should ask them a few important questions:\n1. Does your dentist provide an Authentication Card?\n2. Do they provide a documented Warranty?\n3. Can they show you real live patient case results?\n4. Does your dentist provide 100% transparent pricing with no hidden charges?\n\nAsk your dentist, and if their answer is yes to all of these, then you should definitely go to your dentist! Because our USD Certified Smile Designers provide every single one of these standards.'",
    "details": "CRITICAL REPETITION GUARD: If the user mentions their dentist again later in the conversation, NEVER repeat the 4 questions. Instead, answer their specific question naturally, politely, and directly without sounding scripted.\n\nWHEN USER SAYS THEIR DENTIST HAS ALL FOUR / DOES ALL THAT TOO:\nIf the user responds that their dentist has all four, provides all of these things, has the same standards, does all of that too (e.g., 'My dentist has all four', 'Ye to mere dentist bhi karte hai', 'My dentist has authentication, warranty, cases, and transparent pricing', 'So what's different about USD?', 'What's the difference between my dentist and USD?'):\nAnswer warmly and clearly:\n'Oh, nice! Your dentist may provide all of these things too, and that's completely fine. The main difference is that our USD Certified Smile Designers are specially trained in Smile Design. They complete the USD course and are trained in our specialised protocol.'\nFollow up naturally by asking: 'Would you like to know more about how our specialised Smile Design protocol works?'\n\nIf asked to justify transparent pricing:\nJustify it through our 4 pillars: Certified Smile Designer protocols, master ceramist handcrafting, verified authentication warranty, and 100% all-inclusive pricing without hidden costs."
  },
  "usd_authentication_card_details": {
