    "facts": "Every genuine USD treatment uses premium restorations handcrafted by Advance Dental Export (ADE). The USD Authentication Card is provided to verify the case and confirm that genuine USD-approved restorations were used.",
    "details": "That's an excellent question, and we believe every patient deserves complete confidence in their treatment. Every genuine Ultimate Smile Designing treatment is planned and completed using premium restorations handcrafted by Advance Dental Export (ADE), following the Ultimate Smile Designing philosophy. To help you verify your restorations, your Authorised USD Smile Designer provides a USD Authentication Card. This card contains important information about your case and confirms that your smile was created using genuine USD-approved restorations crafted by Advance Dental Export. Whenever you visit your Certified Smile Designer, we encourage you to ask for your USD Authentication Card. It's your assurance that your treatment follows our quality standards and uses genuine USD products and craftsmanship. Because confidence doesn't come from promises. It comes from authenticity you can verify."
  }
